notes.content:
[h1]Changes[/h1]

[list]
[*] Adds Exit and Start Screen buttons in Menu;
[*] Adds the game developer's discord and x pages to the Start Screen;
[*] Now you can held down Enter button to skip levels faster;
[*] Simplifies Controller interactions in Menu;
[*] New achievements! LVLs 60, 65, 70, 75, 80, 85, 90, 95, 99.
[/list]


All these additions and changes were collected through your Reviews on Steam (with the exception of social networks), so I thank you in advance for the opportunity to always improve my games!


To continue improving Qwepoi, and eventually new games, stay engaged, I'm very happy with the reception! I hope you enjoy and like it!


Thanks for playing!
-Marcos Raoi
